1. Patient web portal
Application Gateway
Public HTTPS + URL-based routing (/api, /static) + WAF + SSL termination → Layer 7 use case

2. Clinical API (internal)
Load Balancer
Internal VNet + TCP (port 8443) + no HTTP inspection → Layer 4 distribution

3. DICOM image streaming
Load Balancer
Large TCP payloads + long-lived connections + non-HTTP → low latency, no inspection

4. Auth service (header routing)
Application Gateway
Header-based routing + multi-tenant routing + end-to-end TLS → Layer 7

5. Legacy SOAP lab service
Load Balancer
Raw TCP (port 9000) + no payload/header modification → Layer 4

6. Admin dashboard (hostname)
Application Gateway
Host-based routing (admin vs www) + HTTPS + autoscaling → Layer 7
